Dobrý deň,

Client complaints (FIN-CMP-04)

Issuer: Tatra Wealth, o. c. p., a. s. · IČO 36 012 445 · Hodžovo námestie 3, 811 06 Bratislava

Log every complaint, spoken or written, in the complaints register within 1 business day.
Acknowledge the client within 5 business days and answer substantively within 30 days; where the answer needs longer, explain why and give a new date.
The answer tells the client they may turn to Národná banka Slovenska as the supervisory authority, and to an alternative dispute resolution body under zákon č. 391/2015 Z. z.
A complaint alleging fraud, unauthorised trading or mis-selling goes to compliance immediately and is not handled by the adviser concerned.
Complaint files are retained for 10 years so a later supervisory review can reconstruct the case.
Complaint themes are reported to the board quarterly, because a pattern is a control failure rather than a series of accidents.

